                <div type="edition" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<div type="textpart" n="A" xml:lang="san-Latn"><head xml:lang="eng">Face A</head>
                   <p>
   <lb n="A1"/>… mrateṅ Añ r…
                      <lb n="A2"/>… vyar saṅkrānta chgganara {1} E…
                      <lb n="A3"/>… Ām sme pāda mvāy dyan jhm…
                      <lb n="A4"/>… teṅ saptamī kvan teṅ vra…
                      <lb n="A5"/>… teṅ mādhavī teṅ dhi teṅ… gho…
                      <lb n="A6"/>… n phqvan gho kandhān teṅ kuṭī kva[n]
                      <lb n="A7"/>… yana gho sudhana gho kañcan te-
                      <lb n="A8"/>[ṅ]… cañ… Amoghapura sre vroḥ
                      <lb n="A9"/>… nrut jaṁhvat piy vroḥ bhay mvāy ta
                      <lb n="A10"/>… mvāy mvāy bhūmi vraḥ caṁnat vroḥ thlvaṅ
                      <lb n="A11"/>… hat sre vroḥ bhay mvāy bhūmi ti {2}
                      <lb n="A12"/>… jeṅ cryal <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> bhūmi śivagupta sre vroḥ bha-
                      <lb n="A13"/>[y]… [bhū]mi pānduraṅga sre vroḥ thlvaṅ prām saṁcoḥ
                      <lb n="A14"/>… y bhay mvāy tap vyar śata ka{1}au
                      <lb n="A15"/>… ṅ jhmār bhay pvan tap pra[ṁ] piy sre
                      <lb n="A16"/>… tap pvan <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> caṁnāṁ nādh viṣaya bhīmap[ura]
                      <lb n="A17"/>...
</p>
                   </div>
                   <div type="textpart" n="B" xml:lang="okz-Latn"><head xml:lang="eng">Face B</head>
                   <p>
   <lb n="B1"/>… de A…
                      <lb n="B2"/>… saṅ ĀCr…
                      <lb n="B3"/>… [ka]mrateṅ jagat…
                      <lb n="B4"/>naCrā {1} sme pāda…
                      <lb n="B5"/>… śata kadeṅ raṅko liḥ prā[m]…
                      <lb n="B6"/>teṅ {2} teṅ cren gho kaṁCr…
                      <lb n="B7"/>teṅ śān teṅ vlut phqvan teṅ su…
                      <lb n="B8"/>sarāga kvan gho saṁroṅ phqvan…
                      <lb n="B9"/>kvan gho khvep {1}e teṅ vraḥ [gh]o…
                      <lb n="B10"/>ṅ bhadreśa <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> gho kansaṁ gho dharmmar…
                      <lb n="B11"/>vroḥ bha[y] mvāy tap {1}e vya[r] {5}
                      <lb n="B12"/>ḥ bhadra phsaṁ Anle prām saṁ nu…
                      <lb n="B13"/>… phsam pamre śata mvāy ta…
</p>
                   </div>
</div>
